    "chunk_text": "Incipit Sermo De Dedicatione Aecclesiae. Lucas se godspellere awrat on \u00fe\u00e6re \u00feriddan Cristes bec \u00fe\u00e6t ure h\u00e6lend Crist w\u00e6s farende to \u00fe\u00e6re byrig \u00dea worhte he wundra be \u00feam wege swaswa his gewuna w\u00e6s. & betwux o\u00f0rum wundrum on \u00feam wege he geh\u00e6lde \u00e6nne blindne, for\u00fean \u00fee he b\u00e6d his h\u00e6le mid & he swa dyde; & \u00fe\u00e6t folc \u00fee \u00feis wundor geseah swi\u00f0e herede god; Se h\u00e6lend ferde \u00fea \u00feurh \u00fea burh \u00dea w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6r sum welig mann ongeanwerd \u00feam h\u00e6lende & hys nama w\u00e6s Zacheus, Se w\u00e6s ealdor & He smeade \u00fea on hys mode, hu he mihte \u00feone h\u00e6lend geseon, for\u00fean\u00fee se ylca rica w\u00e6s sceort on He arn \u00fea beforan ealra \u00fe\u00e6re meniu, & ardlice astah uppan an treow, \u00f0e is on bocum gehaten Hw\u00e6t \u00fea se h\u00e6lend sona swa he him to com, beseah upp wi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s rican, & hine hra\u00f0e het astigan ni\u00feer \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 se h\u00e6lend him to, Nu to d\u00e6g me gedafena\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t ic to \u00feinre dugo\u00f0e gecyrre, & \u00fe\u00e6t ic on \u00feinum Hw\u00e6t \u00fea iudeiscean \u00fe\u00e6s wundrodon swi\u00f0e, & mid ceorunge bem\u00e6ndon \u00fe\u00e6t he to swa synfullum menn \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00fe se h\u00e6lend sona to Zachee \u00feus, Nu to d\u00e6g is gefremmed \u00feisum hirede h\u00e6l, for\u00fean\u00fee he is sunu Mannes bearn com to secenne, & sylf",
